### PHASE 0 (step 0.10): fixed (audit B10) + pagination.
# Run api-requests/auth-service/login.http first - it stores the token in {{token}}.
#
# The old file had a BLANK LINE between the request line and the Authorization
# header. In the .http format a blank line ends the headers, so "Authorization: ..."
# was sent as the request BODY and the gateway answered 401.
#
# PHASE 0 (old):
# ###### GET request to get all patients
#
# #GET http://lb-8813ce00.elb.localhost.localstack.cloud:4004/api/patients
# GET http://localhost:4004/api/patients
#
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### First page (defaults: page=0, size=20, sorted by name)
GET http://localhost:4004/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicit paging and sorting (size is capped at 100)
GET http://localhost:4004/api/patients?page=0&size=5&sort=name,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown sort field -> 400 Problem Details
GET http://localhost:4004/api/patients?sort=password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
